From: =?UTF-8?q?Franti=C5=A1ek=20Bal=C3=A1zsy?= <frantisekbalazsy@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 01:25:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mux: apple,display-crossbar: add the T6041
 per-ATC crossbar
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

T6040/T6041 (M4 Pro/Max) carry one display crossbar per Type-C or HDMI
PHY (ADT atcN-dpxbar, "atc-dpxbar,t604x"), 0x4000 bytes each, which
routes the DISPEXT pipes and the DP IN ports of that ATC. Add the
compatible.

Signed-off-by: František Balázsy <frantisekbalazsy@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 497ef5b9f682ee6607f3eb667d8cf404ea5b2c85)
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mux/apple,display-crossbar.yaml          | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mux/apple,display-crossbar.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mux/apple,display-crossbar.yaml
index eb80cf382a..fcb65f7913 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mux/apple,display-crossbar.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mux/apple,display-crossbar.yaml
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ properties:
       - apple,t8112-display-crossbar
       - apple,t6000-display-crossbar
       - apple,t6020-display-crossbar
+      - apple,t6041-display-crossbar
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
